 weapon evolution</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>45 diverse events</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Over 40 diverse enemies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Difficulty scaling system unlocked upon clearing the basic difficulty</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["SYW Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682390/8fef215a47e2c8f707b6fdfa9753e2187d079317/header.jpg?t=1748110215","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257144882,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144882/movie480.mp4?t=1748110027","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144882/movie_max.mp4?t=1748110027"},"name":"Three Legions Erosion of the Abyss Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257144882/87bb9d592757ac25d9c9a54e7a3f5d9e95ec73ef/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748110027","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144882/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748110027","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144882/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748110027"}}],"name":"Three Legions: Erosion of the Abyss","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 1400 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTS 750 or better<br></li><li><str